<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>CPP-API: Interface to the file system. </para>



<para>Derive an own implementation from this interface to supply custom file handling to the importer library. If you implement this interface, you also want to supply a custom implementation for <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_i_o_stream">IOStream</link>.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para><link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_importer_1a1161f46318af18bb86dfe0fc3edea4df">Importer::SetIOHandler()</link> </para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
