<para><computeroutput>virtual bool Assimp::IOSystem::ComparePaths (const char * one, const char * second) const<computeroutput>[virtual]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para><para>

<para>Compares two paths and check whether the point to identical files. </para>
</para>

<para>The dummy implementation of this virtual member performs a case-insensitive comparison of the given strings. The default IO system implementation uses OS mechanisms to convert relative into absolute paths, so the result can be trusted. 
